  "title": "Regime Consistency of an Entropy-Gradient Coupling: Lyα, BAO and RSD Tests within a Structural Coherence Framework",
  "description": "Structural regime consistency test of EFC's coupling function T(z) across three independent cosmological probes (Lyα P1D, BOSS BAO, BOSS RSD), evaluated using the Structural Coherence Evaluation (SCE) framework against ΛCDM.",
